sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant TLS as TLS Acceptor<br/>8033/TCP (optional mTLS)
    participant Router as Axum Router<br/>Header Passthrough
    participant Chunker as Chunker Services<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Detector as Detector Services<br/>8080/TCP REST
    participant TGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI-compat Server<br/>(optional) REST
    participant Health as Health Server<br/>8034/TCP HTTP

    Note over Client,Health: Classification-with-Generation Flow (v1)
    Client->>TLS: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    TLS->>Router: Decrypt + verify client cert (if mTLS)
    Router->>Router: Filter passthrough headers<br/>Rewrite X-Forwarded-Access-Token → Bearer
    Router->>Chunker: gRPC: Segment text<br/>TLS optional (named profile)
    Chunker-->>Router: Chunked text segments
    Router->>Detector: POST: Evaluate content safety<br/>TLS optional, Bearer token optional
    Detector-->>Router: Detection results
    Router->>TGIS: gRPC: Generate text<br/>No TLS
    TGIS-->>Router: Generated text
    Router->>Router: Aggregate results
    Router-->>TLS: JSON Response
    TLS-->>Client: Classification + Generation result

    Note over Client,Health: Chat Completions Detection Flow (v2)
    Client->>TLS: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    TLS->>Router: Decrypt
    Router->>Detector: POST: Detect chat content<br/>TLS optional
    Detector-->>Router: Detection results
    Router->>OpenAI: POST: Chat completion<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    OpenAI-->>Router: Completion result
    Router-->>TLS: JSON Response
    TLS-->>Client: Detection + Completion result

    Note over Client,Health: Health Check Flow
    Client->>Health: GET /health<br/>HTTP (no TLS, no auth)
    Health-->>Client: 200 OK
    Client->>Health: GET /info<br/>HTTP (no TLS, no auth)
    Health-->>Client: Service info

    Note over Router,Detector: Detector Health Probing
    Router->>Detector: GET :8081/health<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, no auth
    Detector-->>Router: Health status
